@item cmacs/api/cmacs-api-cmd-nav.c
Navigation subcommands (point, goto).
@item cmacs/api/cmacs-api-cmd-search.c
Search subcommands (search, replace, occur).
@item cmacs/api/cmacs-api-cmd-win.c
