@section Customization

@table @code
@item cmacs-gowl-border-width
Border width in pixels (default 2).
@item cmacs-gowl-border-color-focus
Focused window border color.
@item cmacs-gowl-border-color-unfocus
Unfocused window border color.
@item cmacs-gowl-layouts
List of available layout names.
@item cmacs-gowl-default-layout
Default layout applied at startup.
@item cmacs-gowl-autostart
List of commands to spawn when the mode is enabled.
@item cmacs-gowl-default-keybindings
When non-@code{nil} (default), install the dwm-style keybinding set on
